                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.G/263: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-10T19:00:00-05:00">October 10, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>77. Your telegram No. 86, October 4, 1 p.m. Please telegraph any further
                    information you may have as to this matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
